<p>Media playlist is a rich multimedia container for organizing video and audio content into a navigable player layout with a sidebar playlist.</p>
<h2 data-original-level="H2" id="header-media-playlist-example">Example</h2>
<media-playlist><video-player source="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mqT2Q7fke1c" media-title="Example video"></video-player></media-playlist>
